The plate holds roughly 10 raspberries and 4–5 blackberries. A raspberry weighs about 3–4 g and a blackberry about 5 g. That gives about 35 g of raspberries plus 22 g of blackberries, or roughly 55–60 g in total.

Raspberries are about 52 kcal per 100 g and blackberries about 43 kcal per 100 g. That works out to roughly 18 kcal from the raspberries and 10 kcal from the blackberries, or about 28 kcal in total.

